'''Elite''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable through trading, or by purchasing the [[Elite Gamepass]] for 499 Robux.   
== Appearance ==
Elite’s blade is maroon in color with a dark skull seen imprinted on the center. Its guard and handle are both solid black.

== Trivia ==

*There are two other variants of this knife, being the [[Green Elite]] and [[Blue Elite]].
*When buying the [[Elite Gamepass]] for 499 Robux, the player also receives the [[Elitey|Elitey Pet]], [[Elite Radio]], and [[Elite-ify|Elite-ify Effect]].
*It partners with [[Elitey]], [[Green Elite]] and [[Blue Elite]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Elite Set|Elite Set]]. 

